WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.420
Speaker 1: With Donald Trump getting federally&nbsp;
indicted, there have been a number of people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:08.160
