Donald Trump for the crimes that he's accused of.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:19.860
The arguments tend to center around this idea&nbsp;
of healing the country or assuring people that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:23.760
the Department of Justice and law Enforcement in&nbsp;
this country apply the law equally. And they're&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:28.200
not operating in any sort of political fashion.&nbsp;
There have been a number of people in media making&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.720
this case, and I came across this one op ed in&nbsp;
the Hill. I wanted to rebut having to do with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:39.000
this topic. It's called The Nine Reasons Biden&nbsp;
