arguments one by one, to go through all of Chip's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:49.560
nine points and see if any of these arguments&nbsp;
are convincing. So reason number one that CHIP&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:54.840
provides is that first, historical precedents in&nbsp;
the aftermath of Watergate suggest that a pardon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.840 --> 00:01:00.180
would be the best outcome for the nation. On&nbsp;
August 9th, 1974, President Nixon resigned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:05.580
the presidency in the wake of Watergate. One On&nbsp;
September 8th, President Gerald Ford pardoned him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.740
The gesture curtailed the acrimony over continued&nbsp;
Watergate fallout and started the process of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:15.000
moving forward. Though Nixon felt he was innocent&nbsp;
of criminal conduct and should not have to accept&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.080
a pardon, the pardon ended his legal jeopardy&nbsp;
and allowed him to acknowledge he should have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:23.280
handled the situation better. In either case, a&nbsp;
humbling, yet gracious lifeline allowed America&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:29.340
to move forward. Well, just because it happened&nbsp;
once before that one, presidents pardons another.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:33.780
That doesn't mean that it has to happen again.&nbsp;
And it certainly doesn't mean that it was the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:38.520
right move. It doesn't mean that it was right for&nbsp;
Ford to do so. And also, you have to remember that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:45.060
Ford and Nixon were in the same party. Ford was,&nbsp;
of course, Nixon's VP for a time. So there was a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:49.920
political reason to pardon as well to protect the&nbsp;
interests of the Republican Party at the time.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:55.440
Now, you can make the case that the pardon did&nbsp;
allow the country to heal from Watergate and move&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.440 --> 00:02:00.660
forward. But I would argue that we would also have&nbsp;
